§§ `Sections 536.2 to 536.5 -- Elections in writing; procedures before preliminary inquiry`

-- 536.2 An election or a re-election by an accused in respect of a mode of trial may be made by submission of a document in writing without the personal appearance of the accused.
-- src:11942 | 536.2 An election or a re-election by an accused in respect of a mode of trial may be made by submission of a document in writing without the personal appearance of the accused.
