-- src:11951 | (a) assist the parties to identify the issues on which evidence will be given at the inquiry;
-- src:11952 | (b) assist the parties to identify the witnesses to be heard at the inquiry, taking into account the witnesses’ needs and circumstances; and
-- src:11953 | (c) encourage the parties to consider any other matters that would promote a fair and expeditious inquiry.
