§§ `Section 537 -- Powers of justice`

-- 537 (1) A justice acting under this Part may (a) adjourn an inquiry from time to time and change the place of hearing, where it appears to be desirable to do so by reason of the absence of a witness, the inability of a witness
-- who is ill to attend at the place where the justice usually sits or for any other sufficient reason;
