    CONSIDER `the answer of s 540(5) the stenographer shall transcribe`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the evidence is to be transcribed is not settled
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "on request of the justice or of one of the parties"
