    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the justice continues the inquiry is not settled
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "where an accused, whether or not he is charged jointly with another, absconds during the course of a preliminary inquiry"
